Task t0-reverse-lines: read all lines into a list, then print in reverse.

```
Trepiho lines := [];
Trepiho line := Thoke();
Rokomi (line ~= Krupelro) {
    Theki(lines, line);
    line := Thoke();
}
Pil (Trepiho i := Purmo(lines) - 1; i >= 0; i := i - 1) {
    Rashar lines[i];
}
```

Careful: if lines is empty, Purmo(lines)-1 = -1, condition i >= 0 is false, loop doesn't run. Good.

